  "description": "ODUDIA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H80 N8 O3 Yb4. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.350-5.269 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.24-178.35°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H80N8O3Yb4.",
